---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Desktop App | Northstar</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#f3f7ff] text-ink">
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-10">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-teal hover:text-ink">← Back to home</a>

      <section class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-ink/10 bg-white shadow-xl shadow-ink/5">
        <div class="bg-[#0b1220] px-8 py-10 text-white lg:px-12">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-lime">Built for power users</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-6xl">Desktop App</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-8 px-8 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:px-12">
          <div>
            <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-ink/70">A robust desktop experience for teams that need speed, structure, and full control over their workflows.</p>
            <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-ink/60">Our desktop app brings performance, visibility, and reliability into one streamlined workspace so teams can move faster without sacrificing clarity.</p>
            <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <a class="rounded-full bg-teal px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-ink" href="#contact">Get the desktop app</a>
              <a class="rounded-full border border-ink/15 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-ink transition hover:border-teal hover:text-teal" href="/">View all products</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-[#edf4ff] p-6">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-teal">Included</p>
            <ul class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-ink/75">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal"></span><span>High-performance operations</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal"></span><span>Deep workflow visibility</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal"></span><span>Secure team collaboration</span></li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="mt-1 h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-teal"></span><span>Tailored productivity tools</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
